A tournament organized by the [[gLAd]] and the [[VVD]] to get back life to 4on4 QuakeWorld team play.
===Format===
* Round robin
* All matches are {{abbr|GO3|Game of Three}}
* Play, Play, Play ;-)
* Default map pool of 3 maps
===Prize pool===
$1000 (USD) are spread among the players as seen below. Prizes are awarded only to those players who have not lost a single map with {{abbr|WO|Walk Over}}. 
